    <!-- Kontena app mark: the three shapes of Assets/icon.svg, with that file's nested
         transforms flattened into one 0 0 512 512 space. Vector so it stays crisp at any
         render size, unlike the raster icon.png. The transparent canvas rectangle keeps the
         drawing bounds square, so the mark sits in the same padding as the app icon.
         Regenerate from Assets/icon.svg if the artwork changes. -->
